"Search The Dog House, Wolf Gold, Wild West Gold, Great Rhino, Buffalo King and Cleopatra by exact title. Stop when the spin budget ends — do not chase.": t("Suchen Sie The Dog House, Wolf Gold, Wild West Gold, Great Rhino, Buffalo King und Cleopatra nach exaktem Titel. Stoppen Sie, wenn das Spin-Budget endet — nicht nachjagen.","Ищите The Dog House, Wolf Gold, Wild West Gold, Great Rhino, Buffalo King и Cleopatra по точному названию. Стоп, когда бюджет спина кончился — не догоняйте.","Шукайте The Dog House, Wolf Gold, Wild West Gold, Great Rhino, Buffalo King і Cleopatra за точною назвою. Стоп, коли бюджет спіна скінчився — не доганяйте.","Szukaj The Dog House, Wolf Gold, Wild West Gold, Great Rhino, Buffalo King i Cleopatra po dokładnym tytule. Stop, gdy budżet spinów się skończy — nie gonić.","Busca The Dog House, Wolf Gold, Wild West Gold, Great Rhino, Buffalo King y Cleopatra por título exacto. Para cuando acabe el presupuesto — no persigas.","Procure The Dog House, Wolf Gold, Wild West Gold, Great Rhino, Buffalo King e Cleopatra pelo título exato. Pare quando o orçamento acabar — não persiga.","Cherchez The Dog House, Wolf Gold, Wild West Gold, Great Rhino, Buffalo King et Cleopatra au titre exact. Stoppez quand le budget de spins finit — ne chassez pas.","Cerca The Dog House, Wolf Gold, Wild West Gold, Great Rhino, Buffalo King e Cleopatra per titolo esatto. Ferma quando il budget spin finisce — non inseguire.","The Dog House, Wolf Gold, Wild West Gold, Great Rhino, Buffalo King ve Cleopatra'yı tam adla arayın. Spin bütçesi bitince durun — kovalamayın.","Zoek The Dog House, Wolf Gold, Wild West Gold, Great Rhino, Buffalo King en Cleopatra op exacte titel. Stop als het spinbudget op is — niet najagen."),
